1
00:00:00,295 --> 00:00:01,410
Quem avisa a prefeitura

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,866
quando um poste apaga?

3
00:00:03,935 --> 00:00:05,694
Hoje, só quando alguém reclama.

4
00:00:05,704 --> 00:00:06,546
O LuzViva acha

5
00:00:06,556 --> 00:00:07,763
a falha antes.

6
00:00:08,855 --> 00:00:09,459
No site,

7
00:00:09,469 --> 00:00:11,141
o mapa mostra cada poste:

8
00:00:11,151 --> 00:00:12,061
verde funciona,

9
00:00:12,071 --> 00:00:13,130
amarelo está fraco,

10
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,369
vermelho apagou.

11
00:00:15,455 --> 00:00:16,873
Viu um poste apagado?

12
00:00:16,883 --> 00:00:17,611
Manda a foto

13
00:00:17,621 --> 00:00:18,066
e a placa

14
00:00:18,076 --> 00:00:19,669
amarela pintada nele.

15
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:21,302
Aí entra

16
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:22,439
o robô de RPA:

17
00:00:22,449 --> 00:00:23,348
de hora em hora,

18
00:00:23,358 --> 00:00:24,132
ele lê a fila

19
00:00:24,142 --> 00:00:25,405
e abre o chamado.

20
00:00:26,485 --> 00:00:27,055
E ele cobra

21
00:00:27,065 --> 00:00:27,498
o prazo

22
00:00:27,508 --> 00:00:28,783
até a luz voltar.

23
00:00:29,865 --> 00:00:30,855
Esse é o LuzViva:

24
00:00:30,865 --> 00:00:32,060
o site mostra a falha,

25
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:32,537
e o robô

26
00:00:32,547 --> 00:00:33,822
cuida do chamado.
